Apptainer 1.5.5 for Ubuntu 26.04, as mirrored by Terminus

The artifact ghcr.io/projectterminusorg/terminus-node:apptainer-1.5.5-ubuntu-26.04 holds this notice and, unchanged,
files made by the Apptainer project and published in the Apptainer PPA
(https://launchpad.net/~apptainer/+archive/ubuntu/ppa):

- apptainer_1.5.5-1~resolute_amd64.deb, the binary package. Terminus's install script installs it on Ubuntu 26.04
  from the PPA, and takes this copy only when the download from the PPA fails (an HTTP error, no answer, a TLS
  failure, a refused redirect or a partial transfer). A file that does not match its pinned SHA-256, from either
  place, stops the script; it never falls back on a mismatch;
- licences/: the package's licence files, as the package installs them under /usr/share/doc/apptainer/: copyright,
  LICENSE.md.gz, LICENSE_DEPENDENCIES.md.gz and LICENSE_THIRD_PARTY.md.gz;
- source/: the PPA's source package for the same version: apptainer_1.5.5-1~resolute.dsc,
  apptainer_1.5.5-1~resolute.debian.tar.xz and apptainer_1.5.5.orig.tar.gz.

Terminus did not write and does not change these files. Their licences are their authors':

- Apptainer: the BSD 3-Clause licence and the LBNL BSD licence (Copyright (c) Contributors to the Apptainer project,
  established as Apptainer a Series of LF Projects LLC; 2015-2017 Gregory M. Kurtzer; 2016-2017 The Regents of the
  University of California; 2017 SingularityWare, LLC), with the parts that LICENSE_THIRD_PARTY.md.gz and
  LICENSE_DEPENDENCIES.md.gz list under their own licences.
- The helper programs the package carries in /usr/libexec/apptainer/, built from other projects whose source
  tarballs are inside apptainer_1.5.5-1~resolute.debian.tar.xz, each with its own licence file. Among them,
  fuse-overlayfs, PRoot, squashfs-tools (mksquashfs, unsquashfs) and e2fsprogs (fuse2fs) are under the GNU General
  Public License, version 2 (fuse-overlayfs: version 2 or later); others are under permissive licences.

The corresponding source of every program in the package is the source package above, in the same artifact. To read
it: oras pull ghcr.io/projectterminusorg/terminus-node:apptainer-1.5.5-ubuntu-26.04

This notice describes the files; it is not legal advice.
